# Copy to .env, fill in, then: set -a; source .env; set +a
# Optional values are commented out: a set-but-empty ZI_CODE_HASH would be rejected when sourced.
ZI_NETWORK=testnet
ZI_RPC_URL=https://rpc.testnet.fastnear.com
ZI_SCHEME=0u
# v3.2r (current, deployed on testnet 2026-11-12): the reproducible build of the v3.2 source, rebuild commit 4116e69 (the client default; setting it is optional).
# v3.2, 6YtW5oJ8…vMCNHJ (the same source, a non-reproducible build), v3.1, 2prMzXHZ…DaYX, v3, Ut7EQhLD…reWa, v2, 4bQ61AgH…yx9zEA, and v1, Amg4WXKy…GW6k, are history: `zi verify` / `zi replay` still check them, but pay/sweep/init refuse a historical
# invoice. To operate one on purpose (the L3 sweep of LATE-V3) run that one command with ZI_CODE_HASH=<the v3 hash>; do not leave a historical hash here.
ZI_CODE_HASH=BQLSk5carin64UMreToJHT15gvow6wqZSyKqDz7zCFry
# ZI_V32_CODE_HASH: the v3.2 hash (history)
# ZI_V32_CODE_HASH=6YtW5oJ8UtCrzUePQf14zqKMb9G3DUtMynEnZvMCNHJ
# The tUSDC (mock NEP-141, 6 decimals) account id, a public id (not a secret). The client default is the deployed testnet mock
# sm1110-tusdc.testnet; set another id to use your own instance, or set it EMPTY to switch token invoices off.
# ZI_TUSDC_ACCOUNT=sm1110-tusdc.testnet
# The v3 testnet accounts (docs/STABLECOIN.md §2), for reference. The operator created them; the client only needs the keys below.
#   sm1110-zi3-deployer.testnet   sm1110-zi3-merchant.testnet   sm1110-zi3-taxvault.testnet
#   sm1110-zi3-payer.testnet      sm1110-zi3-sweeper.testnet    sm1110-zi3-unreg.testnet
#   late.sm1110-zi3-merchant.testnet (not created in the first v3 run, the "merchant does not exist yet" case; created by its parent for L3, see docs/SPIKES.md "Contract v3.1 live")
#   never.sm1110-zi3-merchant.testnet (never created: the refund_payer case)
#   sm1110-zi3-unreg2.testnet (exists, never registered on tUSDC: the token refund_payer case)
# The record-v3-*.sh scripts use the sweeper account as the merchant, so register the sweeper on tUSDC too, and read
# ZI_UNREG_ACCOUNT, ZI_UNREG2_ACCOUNT and ZI_FAKE_TOKEN_ACCOUNT from .env:
# ZI_MERCHANT_ACCOUNT / ZI_MERCHANT_KEY: sm1110-zi3-merchant, the parent of late.… (scripts/create-late-merchant.ts signs with it)
# ZI_V3_CODE_HASH: the v3 hash, for scripts/record-v31-late.sh (it pins ZI_CODE_HASH to it for one sweep); ZI_V31_CODE_HASH: the v3.1 hash (history)
# ZI_UNREG_ACCOUNT=sm1110-zi3-unreg.testnet
# ZI_UNREG2_ACCOUNT=sm1110-zi3-unreg2.testnet
# ZI_FAKE_TOKEN_ACCOUNT=sm1110-zi3-fake.testnet
# Fill these in (accounts and keys) to sign; leave commented out for offline use:
# ZI_PAYER_ACCOUNT=
# ZI_PAYER_KEY=
# ZI_SWEEPER_ACCOUNT=
# ZI_SWEEPER_KEY=
# ZI_TAXVAULT_ACCOUNT=
ZI_INVOICE_DIR=invoices
# Optional: record RPC calls to this file (fixtures)
# ZI_RECORD=

# Optional: archival endpoint for `zi receipt --tx` (the default RPC prunes transactions after ~1.5 days; this is the default when ZI_RPC_URL is the FastNEAR default)
# ZI_ARCHIVAL_RPC_URL=https://archival-rpc.testnet.fastnear.com
